00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.000
That Mr. Crawford's a bad fella.

00:22:36.510 --> 00:22:38.550
And he might shoot you, just like he said.

00:24:50.160 --> 00:25:00.000
When it comes to Polo, Bradley can play rings around Crawford.

00:25:00.000 --> 00:25:00.460
Meal time.

00:25:03.340 --> 00:25:06.550
