00:25:31.400 --> 00:25:32.120
Thank you.

00:26:10.330 --> 00:26:18.370
your rope. Sneak up on foot. That black cyan, the children of mine, will get it.

00:26:33.320 --> 00:26:37.430
Get some wood for a fire, Wolf. Smoke him out.

00:27:01.370 --> 00:27:02.930
He's trying to tell us something.

00:27:04.020 --> 00:27:08.090
Well, I'm going to find out what he wants.

00:27:30.480 --> 00:27:33.480
If you're out glutton for punishment, he can't stand it much longer.

00:27:33.480 --> 00:27:35.350
He'll be poking his head out here in a minute.
